I would launch it in US West.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.300
And it would be so
close, I would launch it

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.340
and I would have that
whole experience.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.130
And that desktop
would span across all

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:00.880
three of those monitors, a
