it's your Windows 10 image

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.100
and you'll help your users.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.642
But other than that,
underneath that,

00:16:45.642 --> 00:16:48.045
it's a service from Workspot.

00:16:48.045 --> 00:16:49.670
So let's drill into
that a little more.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.920
If you take a look at the
slide here, what's going on?

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.600
We got the Workspot
cloud on top.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.220
And those dotted
lines coming down,

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.230
those are the control
signals that Amitabh

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.730
was talking about a minute ago.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:02.180
Now underneath that, this is the
punchline of everything today,

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.520
it's the end user on the
left and their Windows 10

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.410
desktop on the right.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:07.160
And you would want to
make it so that they

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.140
can connect into that
thing quickly and have

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:11.817
a great experience, that's
what it's all about.

00:17:11.817 --> 00:17:13.609
Well there's three
things in between there.

00:17:13.609 --> 00:17:16.490
We connect into
our Workspot client

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:19.093
that they run on their
device, the end user does.

00:17:19.093 --> 00:17:20.510
And when they fire
off the client,

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.160
it makes a connection
into the cloud

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:25.220
and connects to the gateway for
encryption and authentication

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.280
and various things.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.160
And then it connects
to our agent that

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.480
runs on their Windows 10
desktop up in the cloud,

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:31.830
there's those three things.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.867
So our cloud is configuring
those with the dotted lines.

00:17:34.867 --> 00:17:36.950
And then of course, while
those things are running

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.380
they're reporting back,
making sure things

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.510
are humming along famously.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.410
And so effectively,
it's that simple.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.452
It's simple to operate
and deploy and sort

00:17:45.452 --> 00:17:46.910
of work with this
environment here,

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.800
and we want to keep
it that simple.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:52.550
But realize this, that there's
more going on under the hood.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:56.000
So the IT organization is going
to see this happening below,

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.890
and you can monitor
all this as well.

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.620
On the client side, of
course the Workspot client

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.960
is running on an
endpoint of their choice.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.960
Could be a laptop or
a Mac, or it could

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.742
be a smartphone or tablet.

00:18:07.742 --> 00:18:09.200
It's going to have
various networks

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.950
like wireless networks, or
wired networks, or cellular.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.420
It's going to come
into the cloud,

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.072
then from the cloud it's going
to pick a region of the world,

00:18:17.072 --> 00:18:19.280
and of course it's going to
have a particular gateway

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.280
with a version.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.010
And now once it's in
there, it's actually

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.968
going to connect into
the Workspot agent that's

00:18:23.968 --> 00:18:27.190
running on their desktop,
on their Windows 10 desktop.

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.750
And there's going to be a
specific configuration of CPU,

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:33.290
and storage, and memory to allow
them to run their applications.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:35.990
And connect it into a super
high-speed network in the cloud

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.240
so they can connect
into their files,

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:40.370
their back-end
application servers,

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.470
maybe to their
corporate data center

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.190
as well as into the internet.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.620
So all of this is happening.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.880
The IT Organization.

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.530
Can monitor all
this activity, you

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.450
