00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.630
And it does this so it can
find patterns out there.

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:37.800
Patterns so we can be
proactive about making certain

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.630
that priority one
happens, which is

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.523
that all those users on the
left have a great experience.

00:19:42.523 --> 00:19:44.940
And if there's any trend that
comes out of these patterns,

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.355
like an operating
system that's acting up,

00:19:47.355 --> 00:19:50.730
or a device type, or a
gateway, or a region,

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:52.830
one of those things
