00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.090
with that customer,
but other customers

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.310
that it might affect also.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:03.180
This is single pane of
glass, a NOC for our support

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.160
organization to tell
all this information.

